# CODEOWNERS — review routing for this repository.
#
# CODEOWNERS uses last-match-wins, so the catch-all goes first and the CI
# rules after it. It routes review requests; it is not a merge gate on its
# own. Workflow and composite-action changes run with repository secrets, so
# they always request a maintainer review.
*                       @nleck @Green-Beret
/.github/workflows/     @nleck @Green-Beret
/.github/actions/       @nleck @Green-Beret
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @nleck @Green-Beret
